<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"></head><body><div dir="auto"><p>FYI</p><div class="gmail_quote"><div class="gmail_attr">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: Ada Example &lt;ada@example.com&gt;<br>Date: Tue, Nov 10, 2026 at 3:04 PM<br>Subject: Lunch<br>To: Bo Example &lt;bo@example.org&gt;<br></div><br><p>Hi Ada,</p><p>Friday works. I'll book the table at noon; the menu is at <a href="https://bistro.example.com/menu">https://bistro.example.com/menu</a>.</p><p>Thanks,<br>Bo</p><p>--<br>Bo Example<br>Example Widgets Ltd. | +1 555 0100</p><p>On Tue, Nov 3, 2026 at 9:12 AM Ada Example &lt;ada@example.com&gt; wrote:</p><blockquote style="margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px solid #ccc;padding-left:1ex"><p>Lunch on Friday? I can do noon or 1pm.</p><p>On Mon, Nov 2, 2026 at 6:01 PM Bo Example &lt;bo@example.org&gt; wrote:</p><blockquote style="margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px solid #ccc;padding-left:1ex"><p>We should catch up about the widget launch.</p><ul><li>pricing</li><li>the beta list</li></ul></blockquote></blockquote></div></div></body></html>
